OL,3,GNEWSAParking fees in five town centres
OL,4,Ato be scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharges in a number of town centre car
OL,7,Fparks around Leeds have been scrapped
OL,8,Fafter a public consultation was held.
OL,10,FThe charges - of up to #3.65 a day -
OL,11,Fwere introduced last October in
OL,12,FWetherby, Horsforth, Garforth, Rothwell
OL,13,Fand Guiseley.
OL,15,FJames Gibson, Labour's executive member
OL,16,Ffor environment at Leeds City Council,
OL,17,Fsaid the charges would be abolished
OL,18,Fwith effect from 9 November.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
