OL,3,GNEWSAParking fees in five town centres
OL,4,Ato be scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Having considered the
OL,7,Ffindings of the follow up consultation
OL,8,Fand review, we have decided to remove
OL,9,Fthe district parking charges introduced
OL,10,Fat these six car parks."
